id: 17
hanzi: 股
pinyin: gǔ
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Measure Word

meanings_summary:
  en: classifier for streams, gushes, smells, forces, or passions; share; stock; thigh
  es: clasificador para chorros, corrientes, tufos, fuerzas o impulsos; acción (bursátil); muslo

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Measure Word | Standard | classifier for streams, water gushes, gusts of wind, smells, or surges of strength and emotion | clasificador para chorros, corrientes de agua, ráfagas, olores o impulsos | 三股泉水 (three streams of spring water)
  2 | Noun | Standard | financial share; stock; thigh / portion | acción (financiera); cuota; muslo; porción | 股票 (stocks / shares)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 趵突泉池中央有三股大泉日夜喷涌，水花高达数尺，气势磅礴，蔚为壮观。 | Bàotūquán chí zhōngyāng yǒu sān gǔ dà quán rìyè pēnyǒng, shuǐhuā gāo dá shù chǐ, qìshì pángbó, wèiwéi zhuàngguān. | In the center of Baotu Spring's pool, three massive streams gush day and night, sending plumes feet into the air in a magnificent display. | En el centro del manantial Baotu, tres vigorosos chorros brotan día y noche con ímpetu majestuoso, alcanzando varios palmos de altura.
  #2 | 面对突如其来的市场动荡，这支创业团队凭着一股不服输的顽强拼劲，最终成功实现了技术攻关。 | Miànduì tūrúqílái de shìchǎng dòngdàng, zhè zhī chuàngyè tuánduì píng zhe yì gǔ bù fúshū de wánqiáng pīnjìn, zuìzhōng chénggōng shíxiàn le jìshù gōngguān. | Facing sudden market turbulence, this entrepreneurial team, propelled by a surge of unyielding tenacity, successfully conquered the technical hurdles. | Ante la súbita sacudida del mercado, el equipo de emprendedores, impulsado por una racha de indomable coraje, coronó con éxito el reto técnico.

